hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1497","Mujhe Malik ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar ne apni do laundiyon ko mudabbar banaya aur wo dono mudabbar hote hue un se hambistari karte they."
"1498","Mujhe Malik ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke Saeed bin Musayyab kehte they ke jab shakhs apni laundi ko mudabbar banae to use haq hai ke us se hambistari kare aur use haq nahi ke use beche aur na use hiba kare, aur us ki aulaad usi ke darje mein hai."
"1499","Mujhe Malik se riwayat pahunchi ke Umar bin Abdul Aziz ne mudabbar ke bare mein jab wo zakhmi kare faisla kya ke us ke aaqa ke liye hai ke jo kuchh us mein se us ki milkiyat hai use zakhmi ke hawale kar de, phir zakhmi us se khidmat le aur use apne zakhm ki deet ke badle gine, phir agar wo apne aaqa ke halaak hone se pehle ada kar de to apne aaqa ki taraf laut aae. Malik ne kaha ke hamare nazdeek mudabbar ke bare mein jab wo zakhmi kare phir us ka aaqa halaak ho jaye aur us ka is ke siwa koi maal na ho muamla ye hai ke us ka teesra hissa azaad kya jaye phir zakhm ki aql ko teen hisson mein taqseem kya jaye, phir aql ka teesra hissa us teesre hisse par ho jo us mein se azaad hua hai, aur us ke do teesre hisse un do teesre hisson par hon jo warison ke haathon mein hain, agar wo chahein to jo un ka hai use zakhm wale ke hawale kar dein aur agar chahein to use aql ke do teesre hisse dein aur ghulam mein se apna hissa roke rakhein, aur ye is liye ke is zakhm ki aql ki jinayat ghulam se thi aur aaqa par qarz na thi, to wo jo ghulam ne naya kya wo us cheez ko batil karne wala na tha jo aaqa ne us ki azadi aur tadbeer mein ki thi, phir agar ghulam ke aaqa par logon ka qarz ho ghulam ki jinayat ke sath to mudabbar mein se zakhm ki aql aur qarz ke qadar becha jaye phir aql se ibtida ki jaye jo ghulam ki jinayat mein thi to ghulam ki qeemat se qaza ki jaye phir us ke aaqa ka qarz qaza kya jaye phir dekha jaye ke ghulam mein se is ke baad jo bacha hai us ka teesra hissa azaad kya jaye aur us ke do teesre hisse warison ke liye baqi rahein, aur ye is liye ke ghulam ki jinayat us ke aaqa ke qarz se pehle hai, aur ye is liye ke jab shakhs halaak ho aur mudabbar ghulam chhore jis ki qeemat aik sau pachaas dinar ho aur ghulam ne aik azaad shakhs ko wazeh karne wala zakhm lagaya ho jis ki aql pachaas dinar ho aur ghulam ke aaqa par pachaas dinar qarz ho. Malik ne kaha ke pachaas dinar se ibtida ki jaye jo zakhm ki aql mein hain to ghulam ki qeemat se qaza kiye jain phir us ke aaqa ka qarz qaza kya jaye phir dekha jaye ke ghulam mein se jo bacha hai us ka teesra hissa azaad kya jaye aur us ke do teesre hisse warison ke liye baqi rahein, to aql us ki gardan mein us ke aaqa ke qarz se zyada wajib hai aur us ke aaqa ka qarz us tadbeer se zyada wajib hai jo mayyat ke maal ke teesre hisse mein wasiyat hai, to tadbeer mein se koi cheez jaiz na honi chahiye jab ke mudabbar ke aaqa par qarz ho jo qaza na hua ho aur ye wasiyat hai, aur ye is liye ke Allah Tabarak wa Taala ne farmaya ke wasiyat ke baad jis ki wasiyat ki jaye ya qarz ke baad. Malik ne kaha ke phir agar mayyat ke teesre hisse mein itna ho jis mein mudabbar pura azaad ho jaye to wo pura azaad ho jaye aur us ki jinayat ki aql us par qarz ho jis ka us ka peechha kya jaye us ki azadi ke baad, chahe wo aql puri deet ho, aur ye jab us ke aaqa par qarz na ho. Aur Malik ne mudabbar ke bare mein jab wo kisi shakhs ko zakhmi kare phir us ka aaqa use zakhmi ke hawale kar de phir us ka aaqa halaak ho jaye aur us par qarz ho aur us ne is ke siwa koi maal na chhora ho kaha ke waris kehte hain ke hum use zakhm wale ke hawale karte hain. Aur qarz wala kehta hai ke main is par zyada deta hun, ke jab qareem kuchh zyada de to wo is ka zyada haqdar hai aur jis par qarz hai us se utna kam kya jaye jitna qareem ne zakhm ki deet par zyada diya, phir agar wo kuchh zyada na de to ghulam na le. Aur Malik ne mudabbar ke bare mein jab wo zakhmi kare aur us ka maal ho phir us ka aaqa use fidya dene se inkar kare kaha ke zakhmi mudabbar ka maal us ke zakhm ki deet mein le leta hai, phir agar is mein wafa ho to zakhmi apne zakhm ki deet puri le le aur mudabbar us ke aaqa ki taraf laut jaye, aur agar is mein wafa na ho to use apne zakhm ki deet se taqaza kare aur mudabbar ko us ke zakhm ki deet mein se jo baqi hai us mein istemal kare."
